sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Edge as T: pp-local-edge
    participant Backend as C: pp-server-backend contract / T: runtime
    participant Node as C: pp-compute-node contract / T: service
    participant Cloud as T: configured cloud adapter
    participant Queue as L: durable work / T: V2 adapter
    participant Index as L: verified LanceDB / T: V2 wiring

    Note over Edge,Index: C = source contract; L = legacy-current baseline; T = target runtime; U = unverified live state
    Note over Edge,Index: PR 2 supplies protocol, identity, admission, lease, current-fence, and result shapes only.

    User->>Edge: T: Recall request
    Edge->>Backend: T: Authenticated MCP request
    Backend->>Node: T: Typed embedding request with C: identity and lease
    Node--xBackend: T: Timeout or unhealthy
    Backend->>Backend: T: Record explicit degradation and open circuit

    alt T: Cloud enabled and embedding identity matches
        Backend->>Cloud: T: Explicit fallback request
        alt T: Cloud succeeds
            Cloud-->>Backend: T: Identity-bound derived result
            Backend->>Backend: C: Validate identity, lease, and current fence
        else T: Cloud fails
            Cloud--xBackend: T: Failure with stable reason
            Backend->>Queue: T: Enqueue idempotent derived work
            Backend->>Index: T: Retrieve current verified generation
            Backend->>Backend: T: Fuse text/BM25/symbolic results
        end
    else T: Cloud absent, disabled, or incompatible
        Backend->>Queue: T: Enqueue idempotent derived work
        Backend->>Index: T: Retrieve current verified generation
        Backend->>Backend: T: Fuse text/BM25/symbolic results
    end

    Backend-->>Edge: T: Result with vector_degraded and fallback evidence
    Edge-->>User: T: Render result and provider state

    loop T: Bounded health polling
        Backend->>Node: T: Health, identity, and golden probes
        Backend->>Cloud: T: Health and identity probe when configured
    end
    Node-->>Backend: T: Consecutive valid probes
    Backend->>Backend: T: Wait stable recovery window
    Backend->>Node: T: Final capability probe
    Node-->>Backend: T: Healthy-stable
    Backend->>Queue: T: Reconcile eligible pending work
    Queue-->>Node: T: Leased typed jobs
    Node-->>Backend: T: Idempotent derived results
    Backend->>Backend: C: Accept only the current fencing generation
    Note over Edge,Index: U: MCP returned HTTP 502 in this task; no runtime or production proof.
